TC03 - Verify Dark/Light Theme Toggle Functionality

Test Steps
Step	Action	Expected Result
1	Open https://playwright.dev/	Playwright homepage is displayed successfully.
2	Identify the current theme mode (light or dark) via the page's color scheme/background.	Initial theme state is captured correctly.
3	Click the theme toggle icon in the navigation bar.	The theme switches (light to dark, or dark to light).
4	Verify the page background and text colors have changed accordingly.	Visual theme change is reflected on the page.
5	Reload the page (F5).	Page reloads successfully.
6	Verify the previously selected theme persists after reload.	Theme preference is retained (not reset to default).
7	Click the theme toggle icon again to revert.	The theme switches back to the original mode.

Expected Final Result
The user can successfully toggle between light and dark themes, the visual change is applied correctly, and the selected theme preference persists across a page reload.